=BRIEF
Brand: {{ $json.brand }}
Industry: {{ $json.industry }}
Product / service: {{ $json.product }}
Target audience: {{ $json.audience }}
Campaign topic / offer: {{ $json.topic }}
Goal: {{ $json.goal }}
Platforms: {{ $json.platforms }}
Website: {{ $json.website || "not provided" }}
SEO keywords: {{ $json.keywords || "choose the best ones yourself" }}
Tone: {{ $json.tone }}
Extra notes: {{ $json.notes }}
{{ $json.campaign_context ? "Campaign direction from the marketing director: " + $json.campaign_context : "" }}

CREATE ONLY THESE DELIVERABLES: {{ $json.content_types }}
- "Blog post / article" -> fill "blog" (900-1400 words, SEO-optimised, markdown body with ## headings).
- "Social media posts" -> fill "social_posts" with exactly {{ $json.posts_count }} posts spread across the chosen platforms (Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, Snapchat only). TikTok and Snapchat posts must include a short vertical-video script (hook in the first 2 seconds, scenes, on-screen text).
- "Ad copy" -> fill "ad_copy" with 2 variants per chosen paid platform. Respect limits: Google Ads RSA headlines <= 30 chars (give 5) and descriptions <= 90 chars (give 3); Meta primary text <= 125 chars, headline <= 40; TikTok ad text <= 100 chars; Snapchat headline <= 34 chars.
- "Landing page copy" -> fill "landing_page".
- "Visuals (AI images)" -> fill "visual_prompts" with 3 detailed English image-generation prompts (subject, setting, style, lighting, composition). Never put text inside the image.
Leave every deliverable that was NOT requested as null or an empty array.
Use Google Search to check current trends, hashtags and competitor angles for this market when useful.

JSON shape:
{"big_idea":"","key_messages":[""],"blog":{"title":"","slug":"","meta_title":"","meta_description":"","focus_keyword":"","secondary_keywords":[""],"body_markdown":"","cta":""},"social_posts":[{"platform":"Facebook|Instagram|TikTok|Snapchat","format":"post|carousel|reel|story|video","hook":"","caption":"","hashtags":[""],"cta":"","visual_brief":"","video_script":"","best_time":""}],"ad_copy":[{"platform":"Meta|TikTok|Snapchat|Google Ads","variant":"A|B","headlines":[""],"primary_text":"","descriptions":[""],"cta":""}],"landing_page":{"meta_title":"","meta_description":"","hero_headline":"","hero_subheadline":"","primary_cta":"","sections":[{"title":"","body":""}],"social_proof":"","faq":[{"q":"","a":""}]},"visual_prompts":[{"use":"","aspect_ratio":"1:1|4:5|9:16|16:9","prompt":""}]}
Return ONLY one valid JSON object (no markdown fences, no commentary). Keep JSON keys in English exactly as specified. Write all text values in {{ $json.language }}{{ $json.language === "Arabic (Egyptian)" ? " (natural Egyptian colloquial Arabic that sounds native on social media)" : "" }}, except visual_prompts which are always in English.

